<title>USA: CBOT soy products called to open lower.</title>
<headline>CBOT soy products called to open lower.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>CBOT soy product futures were called to open lower on follow through from Monday's decline, traders said.</p>
<p>A collapse in soybeans Monday triggered by a bearish USDA soybean acreage report led to the calls for a lower-trending market again Tuesday.</p>
<p>Soyoil was called to open 0.10 to 0.20 cent per lb lower and soymeal was called to open $2.00 to $4.00 per ton lower.</p>
<p>((Sam Nelson 312-408-8721))</p>
